# Puppeteer must NOT download a browser here (SB-4, D-#413).
#
# Two reasons, and the first is fatal rather than merely wasteful:
#   1. The deploy host is aarch64, and Puppeteer publishes NO bundled Chromium for
#      linux-arm64. The download either fails or produces nothing launchable, so the
#      only working configuration is a system Chromium reached via
#      PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH — which makes the bundled download pure overhead.
#   2. It is ~150 MB per install on machines that will never render a book.
puppeteer_skip_download=true
